{"id":"gs08","类型":"讲义","科目":"高数","讲":"8","名称":"一元函数积分学的概念与性质","简称":"","简介":"定积分是什么、积分能不能不算就比大小、变限积分怎么求导、反常积分收不收敛。小题最密的一讲：2010–2026 年 26 题 146 分，17 年里 16 年都考。大部分题不用真的算积分；要用到分部积分（第9讲）的地方，提示里会把那一步给你。","intro":[],"sections":[{"id":"1","label":"节1","title":"定积分定义：和式极限化成积分","minutes":35,"kind":"","blocks":[{"t":"goal","text":"考法：$\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}$ 后面跟一串 $n$ 项的和，要你求极限。填空 4–5 分、大题 10 分。2010–2019 年 3 道：2012-10、2016-10、2017-17。"},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"1-d1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\dfrac1n\\sum\\limits_{k=1}^{n}\\left(\\dfrac kn\\right)^2$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\dfrac13$","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"这就是 $\\sum f\\left(\\frac kn\\right)\\cdot\\frac1n$，$f(x)=x^2$，区间 $[0,1]$：$\\int_0^1x^2\\,dx=\\frac13$。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"1-d2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\left(\\dfrac1{n+1}+\\dfrac1{n+2}+\\cdots+\\dfrac1{n+n}\\right)$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\ln2$","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"$\\dfrac1{n+k}=\\dfrac1{1+\\frac kn}\\cdot\\dfrac1n$，$f(x)=\\dfrac1{1+x}$：$\\int_0^1\\dfrac{dx}{1+x}=\\ln2$。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"h","text":"小矩形面积加起来"},{"t":"p","text":"把 $[0,1]$ 等分成 $n$ 段，每段宽 $\\frac1n$；第 $k$ 段右端点是 $\\frac kn$，高取 $f\\left(\\frac kn\\right)$。$n$ 个小矩形面积之和，在 $n\\to\\infty$ 时"},{"t":"math","tex":"\\sum_{k=1}^{n}f\\left(\\frac kn\\right)\\cdot\\frac1n\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\int_0^1f(x)\\,dx."},{"t":"p","text":"曲边梯形被切得越来越细，矩形面积之和就趋于积分。"},{"t":"box","kind":"key","label":"方法","title":"和式极限化积分","body":[{"t":"p","text":"① 从每一项里**提出一个 $\\frac1n$**（宽度）。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 剩下的部分只用 $\\frac kn$ 表示，读出 $f(x)$：把 $\\frac kn$ 换成 $x$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $k$ 从 1 到 $n$（或 0 到 $n-1$）⇒ 区间 $[0,1]$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 常见整理：分母 $n^2+k^2$ 同除 $n^2$；系数 $\\frac k{n^2}=\\frac kn\\cdot\\frac1n$；根号 $\\sqrt{n^2+k^2}=n\\sqrt{1+(k/n)^2}$。"}]},{"t":"box","kind":"why","label":"直觉","title":"","body":[{"t":"p","text":"和式里多一项、少一项不影响极限：一项只是一个宽 $\\frac1n$ 的矩形，$n\\to\\infty$ 时面积趋于 0。所以取左端点（$k=0$ 到 $n-1$）、右端点（$k=1$ 到 $n$）都是同一个积分。"},{"t":"p","text":"但 $k$ 一直加到 $2n$ 就不一样了：$\\frac kn$ 跑到 2，区间变成 $[0,2]$。"}]},{"t":"ex","title":"分母是 n²+k²","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\sum\\limits_{k=1}^{n}\\dfrac{k}{n^2+k^2}$。"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"分子分母同除 $n^2$：$\\dfrac{k}{n^2+k^2}=\\dfrac{k/n^2}{1+(k/n)^2}=\\dfrac{k/n}{1+(k/n)^2}\\cdot\\dfrac1n$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$f(x)=\\dfrac{x}{1+x^2}$，区间 $[0,1]$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$\\int_0^1\\dfrac{x}{1+x^2}dx=\\dfrac12\\ln(1+x^2)\\Big|_0^1=\\dfrac12\\ln2$。"}]]},{"t":"ex","title":"根号","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\dfrac1n\\sum\\limits_{k=1}^{n}\\sqrt{1+\\dfrac kn}$。"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"$\\frac1n$ 已经提好了，$f(x)=\\sqrt{1+x}$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$\\int_0^1\\sqrt{1+x}\\,dx=\\dfrac23(1+x)^{\\frac32}\\Big|_0^1=\\dfrac23\\left(2\\sqrt2-1\\right)$。"}]]},{"t":"box","kind":"warn","label":"易错","title":"","body":[{"t":"ul","items":["提不出 $\\frac1n$，或者提了两次（$\\frac k{n^2}$ 里只能拿走一个 $\\frac1n$，另一个和 $k$ 凑成 $\\frac kn$）。","$k$ 加到 $2n$ 还写 $\\int_0^1$。","剩下的式子里还有单独的 $n$，没完全变成 $\\frac kn$。"]}]},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"1-p1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\sum\\limits_{k=1}^{n}\\dfrac{1}{n+2k}$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\dfrac12\\ln3$","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 分子分母同除 $n$：$\\dfrac{1}{n+2k}=\\dfrac{1}{1+2\\cdot\\frac kn}\\cdot\\dfrac1n$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 把 $\\frac kn$ 换成 $x$：$f(x)=\\dfrac{1}{1+2x}$；$k$ 从 1 到 $n$，区间 $[0,1]$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 原式 $=\\int_0^1\\dfrac{dx}{1+2x}=\\dfrac12\\ln(1+2x)\\Big|_0^1=\\dfrac12\\ln3$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"和式极限 → 每项提出一个 $\\frac1n$，剩下的写成 $\\frac kn$ 的函数，读出 $f$，化成 $\\int_0^1f(x)\\,dx$。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"1-p2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\dfrac1{n^2}\\sum\\limits_{k=1}^{n}k\\,e^{\\frac kn}$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$1$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"$\\dfrac k{n^2}=\\dfrac kn\\cdot\\dfrac1n$，化成 $\\int_0^1xe^x\\,dx$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"分部积分（第9讲）：$\\int xe^x\\,dx=(x-1)e^x+C$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 第 $k$ 项：$\\dfrac{k}{n^2}e^{\\frac kn}=\\dfrac kne^{\\frac kn}\\cdot\\dfrac1n$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $f(x)=xe^x$，区间 $[0,1]$：原式 $=\\int_0^1xe^x\\,dx$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 分部积分：$\\int_0^1xe^x\\,dx=(x-1)e^x\\Big|_0^1=0-(-1)=1$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"$\\frac{k}{n^2}$ 里只拿走一个 $\\frac1n$ 当宽度，另一个和 $k$ 凑成 $\\frac kn$。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"1-p3","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\dfrac1n\\sum\\limits_{k=0}^{n-1}\\cos\\dfrac{k\\pi}{2n}$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\dfrac2\\pi$","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $\\cos\\dfrac{k\\pi}{2n}=\\cos\\left(\\dfrac\\pi2\\cdot\\dfrac kn\\right)$，$f(x)=\\cos\\dfrac{\\pi x}{2}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $k$ 从 0 到 $n-1$：$\\frac kn$ 从 0 跑到 $1-\\frac1n$，区间 $[0,1]$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 原式 $=\\int_0^1\\cos\\dfrac{\\pi x}2dx=\\dfrac2\\pi\\sin\\dfrac{\\pi x}2\\Big|_0^1=\\dfrac2\\pi$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"$\\frac1n$ 已经提好；$k$ 从 0 到 $n-1$ 是左端点和，区间还是 $[0,1]$。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"1-p4","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\dfrac1n\\sum\\limits_{k=1}^{2n}\\dfrac kn$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$2$","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 第 $k$ 项是 $\\dfrac kn\\cdot\\dfrac1n$，$f(x)=x$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $k$ 从 1 到 $2n$：$\\frac kn$ 从 $\\frac1n$ 跑到 2，区间 $[0,2]$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 原式 $=\\int_0^2x\\,dx=2$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"先看 $k$ 跑到哪：$k$ 加到 $2n$，$\\frac kn$ 跑到 2，区间是 $[0,2]$。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"直接求和也能验证：$\\dfrac1{n^2}\\cdot\\dfrac{2n(2n+1)}2=\\dfrac{2n+1}{n}\\to2$。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2012-10","src":{"year":2012,"no":10,"score":4,"type":"填空"},"type":"填空","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}n\\left(\\frac{1}{1+n^2}+\\frac{1}{2^2+n^2}+\\cdots+\\frac{1}{n^2+n^2}\\right)=$ ____。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\dfrac\\pi4$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"把前面的 $n$ 乘进去：第 $k$ 项是 $\\dfrac{n}{k^2+n^2}$，同除 $n^2$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 第 $k$ 项：$n\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{k^2+n^2}=\\dfrac{n}{n^2+k^2}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 分子分母同除 $n^2$：$\\dfrac{n}{n^2+k^2}=\\dfrac{1/n}{1+(k/n)^2}=\\dfrac{1}{1+(k/n)^2}\\cdot\\dfrac1n$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $f(x)=\\dfrac1{1+x^2}$，$k$ 从 1 到 $n$，区间 $[0,1]$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 原式 $=\\int_0^1\\dfrac{dx}{1+x^2}=\\arctan x\\Big|_0^1=\\dfrac\\pi4$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"先把前面的 $n$ 乘进去，每项变成 $\\dfrac{n}{k^2+n^2}$，再同除 $n^2$ 提出 $\\frac1n$。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2016-10","src":{"year":2016,"no":10,"score":4,"type":"填空"},"type":"填空","q":[{"t":"p","text":"极限 $\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{1}{n^2}\\left(\\sin\\frac{1}{n}+2\\sin\\frac{2}{n}+\\cdots+n\\sin\\frac{n}{n}\\right)=$ ____。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\sin1-\\cos1$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"第 $k$ 项 $\\dfrac{k}{n^2}\\sin\\dfrac kn=\\dfrac kn\\sin\\dfrac kn\\cdot\\dfrac1n$，化成 $\\int_0^1x\\sin x\\,dx$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"分部积分：$\\int x\\sin x\\,dx=-x\\cos x+\\sin x+C$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 第 $k$ 项：$\\dfrac{1}{n^2}\\cdot k\\sin\\dfrac kn=\\dfrac kn\\sin\\dfrac kn\\cdot\\dfrac1n$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $f(x)=x\\sin x$，区间 $[0,1]$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 分部积分：$\\int_0^1x\\sin x\\,dx=(-x\\cos x+\\sin x)\\Big|_0^1=\\sin1-\\cos1$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"括号里第 $k$ 项是 $k\\sin\\frac kn$，乘上 $\\frac1{n^2}$ 后：一个 $\\frac1n$ 当宽度，另一个和 $k$ 凑成 $\\frac kn$。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2017-17","src":{"year":2017,"no":17,"score":10,"type":"解答"},"type":"解答","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\sum\\limits_{k=1}^{n}\\dfrac{k}{n^2}\\ln\\left(1+\\dfrac{k}{n}\\right)$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\dfrac14$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"$\\dfrac k{n^2}=\\dfrac kn\\cdot\\dfrac1n$，化成 $\\int_0^1x\\ln(1+x)\\,dx$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"分部积分：$\\int x\\ln(1+x)\\,dx=\\dfrac{x^2}2\\ln(1+x)-\\int\\dfrac{x^2}{2(1+x)}dx$；再用 $\\dfrac{x^2}{1+x}=x-1+\\dfrac1{1+x}$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 第 $k$ 项：$\\dfrac kn\\ln\\left(1+\\dfrac kn\\right)\\cdot\\dfrac1n$，$f(x)=x\\ln(1+x)$，原式 $=\\int_0^1x\\ln(1+x)\\,dx$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 分部（$x\\,dx=d\\frac{x^2}2$）：$\\int_0^1x\\ln(1+x)\\,dx=\\dfrac{x^2}2\\ln(1+x)\\Big|_0^1-\\dfrac12\\int_0^1\\dfrac{x^2}{1+x}dx$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 第一项是 $\\dfrac{\\ln2}2$。多项式除法 $\\dfrac{x^2}{1+x}=x-1+\\dfrac1{1+x}$，所以 $\\int_0^1\\dfrac{x^2}{1+x}dx=\\dfrac12-1+\\ln2=\\ln2-\\dfrac12$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 原式 $=\\dfrac{\\ln2}2-\\dfrac12\\left(\\ln2-\\dfrac12\\right)=\\dfrac14$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"先化成积分：$\\frac{k}{n^2}=\\frac kn\\cdot\\frac1n$；再用分部积分算 $\\int_0^1x\\ln(1+x)\\,dx$。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"10 分分两块：化成积分（写出 $f$ 和区间）一块，分部积分算对一块。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"later","text":"2020 年以后本节还考过：2021-7（中点和）、2025-13。"},{"t":"recap","body":[{"t":"p","text":"$\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}$ 加 $n$ 项的和 → 提出一个 $\\frac1n$ → 剩下的全写成 $\\frac kn$ 读出 $f$ → 看 $k$ 跑到哪定区间 → 化成积分再算；多一项少一项不管。"}]}]},{"id":"2","label":"节2","title":"不算积分也能比大小：比较、对称、周期","minutes":35,"kind":"","blocks":[{"t":"goal","text":"考法：选择题「比较三个积分的大小」。2010–2019 年 3 道：2011-6、2012-4、2018-5；2020 年以后又考了 2 道。"},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"2-d1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int_{-1}^{1}(x^3+1)\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$2$","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"$x^3$ 是奇函数，在对称区间上积分为 0；剩下 $\\int_{-1}^11\\,dx=2$。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"2-d2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$\\int_0^1x\\,dx$ 和 $\\int_0^1x^2\\,dx$ 哪个大？不许算。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\int_0^1x\\,dx$ 大。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"在 $(0,1)$ 上 $x>x^2$，同一个区间上被积函数大的积分大。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"h","text":"四条性质"},{"t":"box","kind":"key","label":"方法","title":"比大小、化简积分","body":[{"t":"ul","items":["**比较**：同一区间 $[a,b]$（$a<b$）上 $f\\le g$，则 $\\int_a^bf\\le\\int_a^bg$；$f\\ge0$ 则积分 $\\ge0$。","**拆区间**：$\\int_a^c=\\int_a^b+\\int_b^c$。上限不同的几个积分比大小，看多出来那一段的正负。","**对称**：$\\int_{-a}^af=0$（$f$ 奇）；$=2\\int_0^af$（$f$ 偶）。先把被积函数拆成奇 + 偶。（公式本：[[积分:sym|对称区间]]）","**周期**：$f$ 周期为 $T$，任何长为 $T$ 的区间上积分都相等：$\\int_a^{a+T}f=\\int_0^Tf$。（公式本：[[积分:period|周期函数]]）"]}]},{"t":"p","text":"比被积函数时常用的不等式（$x>0$）：$\\sin x<x$，$\\ln(1+x)<x$，$e^x>1+x$；$0<x<\\frac\\pi4$ 时 $\\sin x<\\cos x$，$\\tan x<1$。"},{"t":"box","kind":"why","label":"直觉","title":"","body":[{"t":"p","text":"积分是面积。比较：同一块底上，曲线高的面积大。拆区间：$\\int_0^{2\\pi}$ 比 $\\int_0^\\pi$ 多出来的那一段如果在 $x$ 轴下面，就是减掉了一块。对称：奇函数左右两块面积一正一负，正好抵消。"}]},{"t":"ex","title":"先消奇函数","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int_{-1}^{1}\\left(x^5\\cos x+|x|\\right)dx$。"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"$x^5\\cos x$ 是奇 × 偶 = 奇，积分为 0。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$|x|$ 是偶函数：$2\\int_0^1x\\,dx=1$。"}]]},{"t":"ex","title":"拆区间看符号","q":[{"t":"p","text":"比较 $I_1=\\int_0^{\\pi}e^{-x}\\sin x\\,dx$ 和 $I_2=\\int_0^{2\\pi}e^{-x}\\sin x\\,dx$，以及它们和 0 的大小。"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"$I_1>0$：$(0,\\pi)$ 上被积函数为正。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$I_2=I_1+\\int_\\pi^{2\\pi}e^{-x}\\sin x\\,dx$，后一段 $\\sin x<0$，是负的，所以 $I_2<I_1$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"后一段有多负？令 $x=t+\\pi$：$\\int_\\pi^{2\\pi}e^{-x}\\sin x\\,dx=-e^{-\\pi}\\int_0^\\pi e^{-t}\\sin t\\,dt=-e^{-\\pi}I_1$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$I_2=(1-e^{-\\pi})I_1$，所以 $0<I_2<I_1$。"}]]},{"t":"box","kind":"warn","label":"易错","title":"","body":[{"t":"ul","items":["直接去算三个积分，算不出来或算错。先想能不能比被积函数。","拆区间后，每一段的正负判断错了。","对称区间不先拆奇偶，硬算。","比较时用的不等式方向记反（$\\ln(1+x)<x$，不是 $>$）。"]}]},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"2-p1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$\\int_0^1e^x\\,dx$ 和 $\\int_0^1(1+x)\\,dx$ 哪个大？"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\int_0^1e^x\\,dx$ 大。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 在 $(0,1]$ 上 $e^x>1+x$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 同一区间上被积函数大的积分大：$\\int_0^1e^x\\,dx>\\int_0^1(1+x)\\,dx$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 算出来对一下：$e-1\\approx1.718$，$1+\\frac12=1.5$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"同一个区间比积分 → 只比被积函数；用不等式 $e^x>1+x$（$x\\ne0$）。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"2-p2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int_{-2}^{2}\\left(x^3e^{x^2}+1\\right)dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$4$","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $x^3e^{x^2}$：$x^3$ 奇、$e^{x^2}$ 偶，奇 × 偶 = 奇，在 $[-2,2]$ 上积分为 0。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 剩下 $\\int_{-2}^21\\,dx=4$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"对称区间 → 先拆奇偶，奇函数部分直接是 0。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"2-p3","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$I_1=\\int_0^{\\frac\\pi2}\\sin x\\,dx$，$I_2=\\int_0^{\\frac\\pi2}x\\,dx$，$I_3=\\int_0^{\\frac\\pi2}\\sin^2x\\,dx$，把它们从小到大排。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$I_3<I_1<I_2$","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $0<x<\\frac\\pi2$ 时 $0<\\sin x<1$，两边乘 $\\sin x$：$\\sin^2x<\\sin x$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $x>0$ 时 $\\sin x<x$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 所以 $\\sin^2x<\\sin x<x$，积分保持大小：$I_3<I_1<I_2$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"同一个区间 → 比三个被积函数 $\\sin x$、$x$、$\\sin^2x$ 在 $\\left(0,\\frac\\pi2\\right)$ 上的大小。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"也可以算出来对一下：$I_3=\\frac\\pi4\\approx0.785$，$I_1=1$，$I_2=\\frac{\\pi^2}8\\approx1.23$。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"2-p4","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$f$ 是周期为 2 的连续函数，$\\int_0^2f(x)\\,dx=3$，求 $\\int_1^5f(x)\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$6$","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $[1,5]=[1,3]\\cup[3,5]$，每段长 2，是一个周期。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 每段的积分都等于 $\\int_0^2f=3$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $\\int_1^5f(x)\\,dx=3+3=6$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"周期函数在任何长为一个周期的区间上积分都相等；$[1,5]$ 长 4，正好两个周期。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2011-06","src":{"year":2011,"no":6,"score":4,"type":"选择"},"type":"选择","q":[{"t":"p","text":"设 $I=\\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}\\ln(\\sin x)\\,dx$，$J=\\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}\\ln(\\cot x)\\,dx$，$K=\\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}\\ln(\\cos x)\\,dx$，则 $I,J,K$ 的大小关系为（　　）"}],"options":{"A":"$I<J<K$","B":"$I<K<J$","C":"$J<I<K$","D":"$K<J<I$"},"answer":"B","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"同一个区间，只比被积函数；$\\ln$ 递增，只比真数 $\\sin x$、$\\cot x$、$\\cos x$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$0<x<\\frac\\pi4$ 时 $\\sin x<\\cos x<1$，而 $\\cot x>1$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $0<x<\\frac\\pi4$ 时 $0<\\sin x<\\cos x<1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $\\cot x=\\dfrac{\\cos x}{\\sin x}>1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 所以 $\\sin x<\\cos x<\\cot x$；$\\ln$ 递增：$\\ln\\sin x<\\ln\\cos x<\\ln\\cot x$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 同一区间积分保持大小：$I<K<J$，选 B。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"同一个区间 → 只比被积函数；$\\ln$ 递增，只比真数 $\\sin x$、$\\cot x$、$\\cos x$。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2012-04","src":{"year":2012,"no":4,"score":4,"type":"选择"},"type":"选择","q":[{"t":"p","text":"设 $I_k=\\int_0^{k\\pi}e^{x^2}\\sin x\\,dx\\ (k=1,2,3)$，则有（　　）"}],"options":{"A":"$I_1<I_2<I_3$","B":"$I_3<I_2<I_1$","C":"$I_2<I_3<I_1$","D":"$I_2<I_1<I_3$"},"answer":"D","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"拆成 $[0,\\pi]$、$[\\pi,2\\pi]$、$[2\\pi,3\\pi]$ 三段，看每段的正负。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"比较后两段谁的绝对值大：$e^{x^2}$ 越往右越大，而 $\\sin x$ 每段的形状一样。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 被积函数 $e^{x^2}\\sin x$。记 $a_1=\\int_0^\\pi$，$a_2=\\int_\\pi^{2\\pi}$，$a_3=\\int_{2\\pi}^{3\\pi}$。$\\sin x$ 在三段上依次为正、负、正，所以 $a_1>0$，$a_2<0$，$a_3>0$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $I_2=I_1+a_2<I_1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $I_3=I_1+a_2+a_3$，要看 $a_2+a_3$ 的正负。$a_3$ 中令 $x=t+\\pi$：$\\sin(t+\\pi)=-\\sin t$，$t\\in[\\pi,2\\pi]$ 时 $-\\sin t=|\\sin t|$，所以 $a_3=\\int_\\pi^{2\\pi}e^{(t+\\pi)^2}|\\sin t|\\,dt$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 而 $|a_2|=\\int_\\pi^{2\\pi}e^{t^2}|\\sin t|\\,dt$。同一区间上 $e^{(t+\\pi)^2}>e^{t^2}$，所以 $a_3>|a_2|$，$a_2+a_3>0$，$I_3>I_1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑤ $I_2<I_1<I_3$，选 D。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"上限不同 → 拆成 $[0,\\pi]$、$[\\pi,2\\pi]$、$[2\\pi,3\\pi]$ 三段看正负；要比后两段谁大，就换元把它们放到同一个区间上比。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"套路：上限不同就拆区间；两段要比绝对值，平移到同一个区间再比被积函数。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2018-05","src":{"year":2018,"no":5,"score":4,"type":"选择"},"type":"选择","q":[{"t":"p","text":"设 $M=\\int_{-\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\dfrac{(1+x)^2}{1+x^2}\\,dx$，$N=\\int_{-\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\dfrac{1+x}{e^x}\\,dx$，$K=\\int_{-\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\left(1+\\sqrt{\\cos x}\\right)dx$，则（　　）"}],"options":{"A":"$M>N>K$","B":"$M>K>N$","C":"$K>M>N$","D":"$K>N>M$"},"answer":"C","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"$M$：展开 $(1+x)^2=1+x^2+2x$，拆出奇函数。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$M=\\pi$。再看 $N$、$K$ 的被积函数和 1 比谁大（区间长度是 $\\pi$）。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $M$：$\\dfrac{(1+x)^2}{1+x^2}=\\dfrac{1+x^2+2x}{1+x^2}=1+\\dfrac{2x}{1+x^2}$。$\\dfrac{2x}{1+x^2}$ 是奇函数，积分为 0，所以 $M=\\int_{-\\frac\\pi2}^{\\frac\\pi2}1\\,dx=\\pi$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $N$：$e^x\\ge1+x$（只在 $x=0$ 取等），所以 $\\dfrac{1+x}{e^x}\\le1$，且不恒等于 1，$N<\\pi$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $K$：$\\cos x\\ge0$，$1+\\sqrt{\\cos x}\\ge1$（只在端点取等），$K>\\pi$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ $K>M>N$，选 C。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"三个积分区间相同、长度都是 $\\pi$ → 把每个被积函数和 1 比；$M$ 先拆出奇函数，正好等于 $\\pi$。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"「和常数比」是比较积分的常用中介：先找一个能算出来的（$M=\\pi$），另外两个都和它比。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"later","text":"2020 年以后本节还考过：2022-7、2023-15（周期 / 平移）。"},{"t":"recap","body":[{"t":"p","text":"比较积分 → 先别算 → 同区间：比被积函数（$\\ln$、平方这类单调变换先剥掉）→ 上限不同：拆区间看多出那段的符号，必要时换元比两段的绝对值 → 对称区间：先消奇函数 → 周期：长为 $T$ 的区间都一样。"}]}]},{"id":"3","label":"节3","title":"平均值与积分中值定理","minutes":25,"kind":"","blocks":[{"t":"goal","text":"考法：「求 $f$ 在区间上的平均值」，常和变限积分一起出 11 分大题。2010–2019 年 1 道（2016-21），2026 年又考了一道填空。"},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"3-d1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $x^2$ 在 $[0,3]$ 上的平均值。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$3$","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"$\\dfrac1{3-0}\\int_0^3x^2\\,dx=\\dfrac13\\cdot9=3$。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"3-d2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$f$ 在 $[0,1]$ 上连续，$\\int_0^1f(x)\\,dx=0$。$f$ 在 $[0,1]$ 上一定有零点吗？"}],"options":{},"answer":"一定有。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"积分中值定理：存在 $\\xi\\in[0,1]$，$\\int_0^1f=f(\\xi)\\cdot1$，所以 $f(\\xi)=0$。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"h","text":"平均值 = 面积 ÷ 底"},{"t":"math","tex":"\\bar f=\\frac1{b-a}\\int_a^bf(x)\\,dx."},{"t":"p","text":"**积分中值定理**：$f$ 在 $[a,b]$ 上连续，就存在 $\\xi\\in[a,b]$，使 $\\int_a^bf(x)\\,dx=f(\\xi)(b-a)$——平均值一定被 $f$ 在某点取到。（公式本：[[积分:mvt|积分中值定理]]）"},{"t":"box","kind":"key","label":"方法","title":"f 本身是变限积分时，求 ∫f","body":[{"t":"p","text":"$f(x)=\\int_0^xg(t)\\,dt$，要算 $\\int_0^bf(x)\\,dx$：分部积分（$u=f$，$dv=dx$，取 $v=x-b$）："},{"t":"math","tex":"\\begin{aligned}\\int_0^bf(x)\\,dx&=(x-b)f(x)\\Big|_0^b\\\\&\\quad-\\int_0^b(x-b)g(x)\\,dx\\\\&=\\int_0^b(b-x)g(x)\\,dx.\\end{aligned}"},{"t":"p","text":"（边界项：$x=b$ 时 $x-b=0$，$x=0$ 时 $f(0)=0$。）这样 $f$ 就不用求出来了。"}]},{"t":"ex","title":"变限积分的平均值","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$f(x)=\\int_0^x\\dfrac{\\sin t}{t-\\pi}dt$，求 $f$ 在 $[0,\\pi]$ 上的平均值。"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"$\\int_0^\\pi f(x)\\,dx=\\int_0^\\pi(\\pi-t)\\dfrac{\\sin t}{t-\\pi}dt=-\\int_0^\\pi\\sin t\\,dt=-2$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"平均值 $=\\dfrac{-2}{\\pi}$。"}]]},{"t":"ex","title":"用中值定理估计","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\int_n^{n+1}\\dfrac{\\sin x}{x}dx$。"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"积分中值定理：$\\int_n^{n+1}\\dfrac{\\sin x}xdx=\\dfrac{\\sin\\xi_n}{\\xi_n}$，$n\\le\\xi_n\\le n+1$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$\\left|\\dfrac{\\sin\\xi_n}{\\xi_n}\\right|\\le\\dfrac1n\\to0$，极限为 0。"}]]},{"t":"box","kind":"warn","label":"易错","title":"","body":[{"t":"ul","items":["平均值忘了除以区间长度。","用了积分中值定理却没写 $f$ 连续。","$f$ 是变限积分时，想先把 $f$ 求出来——很多时候求不出来（比如 $\\int_0^x\\frac{\\sin t}tdt$），用上面的分部公式绕过去。"]}]},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"3-p1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\sin x$ 在 $[0,\\pi]$ 上的平均值。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\dfrac2\\pi$","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $\\int_0^\\pi\\sin x\\,dx=-\\cos x\\Big|_0^\\pi=1-(-1)=2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 区间长 $\\pi$，平均值 $\\dfrac2\\pi$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"平均值 = 积分 ÷ 区间长度。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"3-p2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$f(x)=\\int_0^x\\dfrac{dt}{1+t}$，用分部公式求 $f$ 在 $[0,1]$ 上的平均值。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$2\\ln2-1$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"$\\int_0^1f(x)\\,dx=\\int_0^1\\dfrac{1-t}{1+t}dt$，$\\dfrac{1-t}{1+t}=\\dfrac2{1+t}-1$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 这里 $g(t)=\\dfrac1{1+t}$，$b=1$：$\\int_0^1f(x)\\,dx=\\int_0^1\\dfrac{1-t}{1+t}dt$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $\\dfrac{1-t}{1+t}=\\dfrac{2-(1+t)}{1+t}=\\dfrac2{1+t}-1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $\\int_0^1\\left(\\dfrac2{1+t}-1\\right)dt=2\\ln2-1$。区间长 1，平均值就是 $2\\ln2-1$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"$f$ 是变限积分 → 用本节的分部公式 $\\int_0^bf(x)\\,dx=\\int_0^b(b-t)g(t)\\,dt$，不用先求 $f$。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"这题 $f$ 能求出来：$f(x)=\\ln(1+x)$，$\\int_0^1\\ln(1+x)\\,dx=2\\ln2-1$，结果一致。真题里的 $f$ 往往求不出来，只能走分部公式。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"3-p3","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac1x\\int_0^x\\cos t^2\\,dt$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$1$","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $\\cos t^2$ 连续，积分中值定理：$\\int_0^x\\cos t^2\\,dt=x\\cos\\xi^2$，$\\xi$ 在 0 和 $x$ 之间。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 原式 $=\\cos\\xi^2$。$x\\to0$ 时 $\\xi$ 被夹在 0 和 $x$ 之间，$\\xi\\to0$，$\\cos\\xi^2\\to1$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"$\\frac1x\\int_0^x\\cos t^2\\,dt$ 就是 $\\cos t^2$ 在 $[0,x]$ 上的平均值 → 积分中值定理：平均值被某一点 $\\xi$ 取到。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"洛必达也行：分子求导 $\\cos x^2$，分母求导 1，极限 1。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2016-21","src":{"year":2016,"no":21,"score":11,"type":"解答"},"type":"解答","q":[{"t":"p","text":"已知函数 $f(x)$ 在 $\\left[0,\\dfrac{3\\pi}{2}\\right]$ 上连续，在 $\\left(0,\\dfrac{3\\pi}{2}\\right)$ 内是函数 $\\dfrac{\\cos x}{2x-3\\pi}$ 的一个原函数，且 $f(0)=0$。（Ⅰ）求 $f(x)$ 在区间 $\\left[0,\\dfrac{3\\pi}{2}\\right]$ 上的平均值；（Ⅱ）证明 $f(x)$ 在区间 $\\left(0,\\dfrac{3\\pi}{2}\\right)$ 内存在唯一零点。"}],"options":{},"answer":"（Ⅰ）$\\dfrac1{3\\pi}$；（Ⅱ）证明见解答。","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"$f(x)=\\int_0^x\\dfrac{\\cos t}{2t-3\\pi}dt$，求不出来。用本节的分部公式算 $\\int_0^{\\frac{3\\pi}2}f$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$\\left(\\dfrac{3\\pi}2-t\\right)\\cdot\\dfrac{\\cos t}{2t-3\\pi}=-\\dfrac{\\cos t}2$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"（Ⅱ）看 $f'$ 的符号：$(0,\\frac\\pi2)$ 上 $f$ 减，$(\\frac\\pi2,\\frac{3\\pi}2)$ 上 $f$ 增。再用（Ⅰ）的平均值是正的。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 写出 $f$：$f(x)=\\int_0^x\\dfrac{\\cos t}{2t-3\\pi}dt$（满足 $f(0)=0$，且 $f'(x)=\\dfrac{\\cos x}{2x-3\\pi}$）。"},{"t":"p","text":"② （Ⅰ）记 $b=\\dfrac{3\\pi}2$。分部公式：$\\int_0^bf(x)\\,dx=\\int_0^b(b-t)\\dfrac{\\cos t}{2t-3\\pi}dt$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $b-t=-\\dfrac{2t-3\\pi}{2}$，约掉分母：$(b-t)\\cdot\\dfrac{\\cos t}{2t-3\\pi}=-\\dfrac{\\cos t}2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ $\\int_0^b\\left(-\\dfrac{\\cos t}2\\right)dt=-\\dfrac12\\sin t\\Big|_0^{\\frac{3\\pi}2}=\\dfrac12$。平均值 $=\\dfrac{1/2}{3\\pi/2}=\\dfrac1{3\\pi}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑤ （Ⅱ）$f'(x)=\\dfrac{\\cos x}{2x-3\\pi}$，在 $\\left(0,\\frac{3\\pi}2\\right)$ 上分母 $2x-3\\pi<0$。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑥ $\\left(0,\\frac\\pi2\\right)$ 上 $\\cos x>0$，$f'<0$，$f$ 减；$f(0)=0$，所以 $f<0$ 在 $\\left(0,\\frac\\pi2\\right]$ 上，这一段没有零点。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑦ $\\left(\\frac\\pi2,\\frac{3\\pi}2\\right)$ 上 $\\cos x<0$，$f'>0$，$f$ 严格增。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑧ 如果 $f\\left(\\frac{3\\pi}2\\right)\\le0$：$f$ 在 $\\left(\\frac\\pi2,\\frac{3\\pi}2\\right)$ 上增，那里 $f<f\\left(\\frac{3\\pi}2\\right)\\le0$；又在 $\\left(0,\\frac\\pi2\\right]$ 上为负。于是 $f$ 在整个 $\\left(0,\\frac{3\\pi}2\\right)$ 上都 $<0$，积分 $<0$，和（Ⅰ）的 $\\int_0^{\\frac{3\\pi}2}f=\\frac12>0$ 矛盾。所以 $f\\left(\\frac{3\\pi}2\\right)>0$。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑨ $f\\left(\\frac\\pi2\\right)<0<f\\left(\\frac{3\\pi}2\\right)$，$f$ 在 $\\left[\\frac\\pi2,\\frac{3\\pi}2\\right]$ 上连续且严格增：零点定理给出存在，单调给出唯一。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"（Ⅰ）$f$ 是求不出来的变限积分 → 用分部公式 $\\int_0^bf=\\int_0^b(b-t)f'(t)\\,dt$，$(b-t)$ 正好约掉分母。（Ⅱ）$f'$ 的符号分两段 → 单调性；右端点的值算不出来，用（Ⅰ）的积分为正倒推它为正。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"（Ⅱ）的关键一步是借用（Ⅰ）：大题的前一问常常就是后一问的工具。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"later","text":"2020 年以后本节还考过：2026-15。"},{"t":"recap","body":[{"t":"p","text":"平均值 → $\\frac1{b-a}\\int_a^bf$ → $f$ 是求不出的变限积分：$\\int_0^bf=\\int_0^b(b-t)g(t)\\,dt$ → 积分中值：连续函数的平均值一定被取到，常用来证有零点或估计极限。"}]}]},{"id":"4","label":"节4","title":"变限积分求导","minutes":35,"kind":"","blocks":[{"t":"goal","text":"考法：填空「求变限积分函数在某点的导数」；大题「由含变限积分的方程求 $f$」。2010–2019 年 2 道：2015-11、2018-16。"},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"4-d1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\int_0^{x^2}\\sin t\\,dt$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$2x\\sin x^2$","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"上限 $u=x^2$：被积函数在上限的值 × 上限的导数，$\\sin(x^2)\\cdot2x$。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"4-d2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\int_x^1e^{t^2}dt$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$-e^{x^2}$","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"$\\int_x^1=-\\int_1^x$，导数 $-e^{x^2}$。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"h","text":"公式和一个前提"},{"t":"math","tex":"\\begin{aligned}&\\frac{d}{dx}\\int_{v(x)}^{u(x)}f(t)\\,dt\\\\&=f\\big(u(x)\\big)u'(x)-f\\big(v(x)\\big)v'(x).\\end{aligned}"},{"t":"p","text":"**前提**：被积函数里只有 $t$，没有 $x$。有 $x$ 就先把它弄出去。（公式本：[[导数:vlim|变限积分求导]]）"},{"t":"box","kind":"key","label":"方法","title":"被积函数里有 x","body":[{"t":"p","text":"① $x$ 是乘在外面的因子：直接提到积分号外，$\\int_0^xxf(t)\\,dt=x\\int_0^xf(t)\\,dt$，再按乘积求导。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $x$ 和 $t$ 搅在一起，如 $f(x-t)$、$f(xt)$：换元。"},{"t":"p","text":"$\\int_0^xf(x-t)\\,dt$：令 $u=x-t$，$=\\int_0^xf(u)\\,du$。"},{"t":"p","text":"$\\int_0^1f(xt)\\,dt$：令 $u=xt$，$=\\dfrac1x\\int_0^xf(u)\\,du$（$x\\ne0$）。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 换元时上下限一起换，$x$ 在积分里当常数。"}]},{"t":"box","kind":"why","label":"直觉","title":"","body":[{"t":"p","text":"$F(x)=\\int_a^xf(t)\\,dt$ 是从 $a$ 到 $x$ 的面积。$x$ 往右挪一点 $\\Delta x$，面积多出一条宽 $\\Delta x$、高约 $f(x)$ 的窄条，所以 $F'(x)=f(x)$。上限是 $u(x)$ 时，窄条宽度是 $u'(x)\\Delta x$，于是多乘一个 $u'(x)$。"}]},{"t":"ex","title":"(x−t) 型","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$F(x)=\\int_0^x(x-t)f(t)\\,dt$，$f$ 连续。求 $F'(x)$、$F''(x)$。"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"拆开，$x$ 提出去：$F(x)=x\\int_0^xf(t)\\,dt-\\int_0^xtf(t)\\,dt$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$F'(x)=\\int_0^xf(t)\\,dt+xf(x)-xf(x)=\\int_0^xf(t)\\,dt$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$F''(x)=f(x)$。"}]]},{"t":"ex","title":"f(x−t) 型","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$f$ 连续，$\\int_0^xf(x-t)\\,dt=x^3$，求 $f(x)$。"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"令 $u=x-t$：$t=0$ 时 $u=x$，$t=x$ 时 $u=0$，$dt=-du$。$\\int_0^xf(x-t)\\,dt=\\int_x^0f(u)(-du)=\\int_0^xf(u)\\,du$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$\\int_0^xf(u)\\,du=x^3$，两边求导：$f(x)=3x^2$。"}]]},{"t":"box","kind":"warn","label":"易错","title":"","body":[{"t":"ul","items":["被积函数里有 $x$ 还直接套公式：$\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\int_0^xxf(t)\\,dt\\ne xf(x)$。","换元后上下限没跟着换，或漏了 $dt=-du$ 的负号。","上限是 $x^2$，忘了乘 $2x$。"]}]},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"4-p1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$F(x)=\\int_0^{x^2}xe^t\\,dt$，求 $F'(1)$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$3e-1$","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $F(x)=x\\int_0^{x^2}e^t\\,dt$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 乘积求导：$F'(x)=\\int_0^{x^2}e^t\\,dt+x\\cdot e^{x^2}\\cdot2x$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 代 $x=1$：$\\int_0^1e^t\\,dt=e-1$，第二项 $=2e$。$F'(1)=3e-1$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"被积函数里有 $x$，而且是乘在外面的因子 → 先提到积分号外，再按乘积求导；上限是 $x^2$ 要乘 $2x$。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"4-p2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{\\int_0^x\\sin t^2\\,dt}{x^3}$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\dfrac13$","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $x\\to0$ 时分子分母都 $\\to0$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 洛必达：分子导数 $\\sin x^2$，分母导数 $3x^2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $\\sin x^2\\sim x^2$，所以 $\\dfrac{\\sin x^2}{3x^2}\\to\\dfrac13$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"$\\frac00$ 型、分子是变限积分 → 洛必达，分子求导直接用变限积分求导公式。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"4-p3","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$F(x)=\\int_0^x(x-t)\\cos t\\,dt$，求 $F''(x)$，并求出 $F(x)$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$F''(x)=\\cos x$；$F(x)=1-\\cos x$。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $F(x)=x\\int_0^x\\cos t\\,dt-\\int_0^xt\\cos t\\,dt$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $F'(x)=\\int_0^x\\cos t\\,dt+x\\cos x-x\\cos x=\\int_0^x\\cos t\\,dt=\\sin x$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $F''(x)=\\cos x$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ $F(0)=0$，所以 $F(x)=\\int_0^xF'(s)\\,ds=\\int_0^x\\sin s\\,ds=1-\\cos x$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"$(x-t)$ 型 → 拆开把 $x$ 提出去再求导；要 $F$ 本身就把 $F'$ 积回去，用 $F(0)=0$。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"4-p4","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$f$ 连续，$\\int_0^1f(xt)\\,dt=\\dfrac{x^2}3$（$x\\ne0$），求 $f(x)$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$f(x)=x^2$","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 令 $u=xt$（$x$ 当常数）：$t=0$ 时 $u=0$，$t=1$ 时 $u=x$，$dt=\\dfrac{du}x$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $\\int_0^1f(xt)\\,dt=\\dfrac1x\\int_0^xf(u)\\,du=\\dfrac{x^2}3$，所以 $\\int_0^xf(u)\\,du=\\dfrac{x^3}3$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 两边求导：$f(x)=x^2$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"$f(xt)$ 型，$x$ 和 $t$ 搅在一起 → 令 $u=xt$ 把 $x$ 移到上限，再求导。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2015-11","src":{"year":2015,"no":11,"score":4,"type":"填空"},"type":"填空","q":[{"t":"p","text":"设函数 $f(x)$ 连续，$\\varphi(x)=\\int_0^{x^2}xf(t)\\,dt$。若 $\\varphi(1)=1$，$\\varphi'(1)=5$，则 $f(1)=$ ____。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$2$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"先把 $x$ 提出去：$\\varphi(x)=x\\int_0^{x^2}f(t)\\,dt$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$\\varphi(1)=\\int_0^1f(t)\\,dt=1$；再按乘积求导。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $\\varphi(x)=x\\int_0^{x^2}f(t)\\,dt$。代 $x=1$：$\\varphi(1)=\\int_0^1f(t)\\,dt=1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 乘积求导：$\\varphi'(x)=\\int_0^{x^2}f(t)\\,dt+x\\cdot f(x^2)\\cdot2x$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 代 $x=1$：$\\varphi'(1)=\\int_0^1f(t)\\,dt+2f(1)=1+2f(1)=5$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ $f(1)=2$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"被积函数里的 $x$ 是乘在外面的因子 → 先提出去，再乘积求导；$\\varphi(1)$ 给出 $\\int_0^1f$，$\\varphi'(1)$ 给出 $f(1)$。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2018-16","src":{"year":2018,"no":16,"score":10,"type":"解答"},"type":"解答","q":[{"t":"p","text":"已知连续函数 $f(x)$ 满足 $\\int_0^x f(t)\\,dt+\\int_0^x tf(x-t)\\,dt=ax^2$。（Ⅰ）求 $f(x)$；（Ⅱ）若 $f(x)$ 在区间 $[0,1]$ 上的平均值为 1，求 $a$ 的值。"}],"options":{},"answer":"（Ⅰ）$f(x)=2a\\left(1-e^{-x}\\right)$；（Ⅱ）$a=\\dfrac e2$。","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"第二项令 $u=x-t$：$\\int_0^xtf(x-t)\\,dt=\\int_0^x(x-u)f(u)\\,du$，就是本节例题的 $(x-t)$ 型。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"求导一次：$f(x)+\\int_0^xf(u)\\,du=2ax$；再求导一次：$f'(x)+f(x)=2a$，并且 $f(0)=0$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"解 $f'+f=2a$：令 $g=f-2a$，则 $g'=-g$，$g=Ce^{-x}$（第15讲会系统学）。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 第二项令 $u=x-t$（$t=0$ 时 $u=x$，$t=x$ 时 $u=0$，$dt=-du$）：$\\int_0^xtf(x-t)\\,dt=\\int_0^x(x-u)f(u)\\,du=x\\int_0^xf(u)\\,du-\\int_0^xuf(u)\\,du$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 原方程两边求导：$f(x)+\\int_0^xf(u)\\,du+xf(x)-xf(x)=2ax$，即 $f(x)+\\int_0^xf(u)\\,du=2ax$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 令 $x=0$：$f(0)=0$。再求导：$f'(x)+f(x)=2a$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 令 $g=f-2a$：$g'=f'=2a-f=-g$，所以 $g=Ce^{-x}$。$g(0)=f(0)-2a=-2a$，$C=-2a$。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑤ $f(x)=2a-2ae^{-x}=2a\\left(1-e^{-x}\\right)$。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑥ （Ⅱ）区间长 1，平均值 $=\\int_0^1f(x)\\,dx=2a\\left[x+e^{-x}\\right]_0^1=2a\\cdot e^{-1}=1$，$a=\\dfrac e2$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"方程里有变限积分 → 先换元把 $x$ 从被积函数里弄出去，再求导两次消掉积分，得到 $f'+f=2a$；求导之前令 $x=0$ 拿初值。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"第③步「令 $x=0$」最容易忘：求导会丢掉常数，初值要在求导之前从方程里拿。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"later","text":"2020 年以后本节还考过：2026-18。"},{"t":"recap","body":[{"t":"p","text":"变限积分求导 → 先看被积函数里有没有 $x$ → 乘在外面就提出去，搅在一起就换元（$u=x-t$、$u=xt$，上下限一起换）→ 再用「上限值 × 上限导数 − 下限值 × 下限导数」→ 方程里有变限积分：求导消掉积分，别忘了令 $x=0$ 拿初值。"}]}]},{"id":"5","label":"节5","title":"变限积分的连续、可导和奇偶","minutes":30,"kind":"","blocks":[{"t":"goal","text":"考法：选择题「被积函数分段，问 $F$ 在分段点连续还是可导」「判断变限积分的奇偶性」；大题「证明导函数在 0 处连续」。2010–2019 年 1 道（2013-3）；2020、2024 年各一道。"},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"5-d1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$f(x)=\\begin{cases}-1,&x<0\\\\1,&x\\ge0\\end{cases}$，$F(x)=\\int_0^xf(t)\\,dt$。$F$ 在 0 处可导吗？"}],"options":{},"answer":"连续但不可导。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"$F(x)=|x|$。左导数 $-1$，右导数 $1$。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"5-d2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$f$ 是连续的奇函数，$F(x)=\\int_0^xf(t)\\,dt$ 是奇函数还是偶函数？"}],"options":{},"answer":"偶函数。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"$F(-x)=\\int_0^{-x}f(t)\\,dt$，令 $t=-s$：$=\\int_0^xf(-s)(-ds)=\\int_0^xf(s)\\,ds=F(x)$。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"h","text":"F 比 f 光滑一级"},{"t":"box","kind":"key","label":"方法","title":"F(x)=∫ₐˣ f(t)dt 在 x₀ 处","body":[{"t":"ul","items":["$f$ 可积（有界、只有有限个间断点）⇒ $F$ 连续。","$f$ 在 $x_0$ 连续 ⇒ $F'(x_0)=f(x_0)$。","$f$ 在 $x_0$ 是**跳跃**间断点 ⇒ $F$ 在 $x_0$ 左导数 $=f(x_0^-)$，右导数 $=f(x_0^+)$，不相等，**不可导**。","$f$ 在 $x_0$ 是**可去**间断点 ⇒ $F$ 可导，$F'(x_0)=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to x_0}f(x)$（不是 $f(x_0)$）。"]}]},{"t":"box","kind":"key","label":"方法","title":"奇偶性","body":[{"t":"ul","items":["$f$ 奇 ⇒ $\\int_a^xf(t)\\,dt$ 偶（下限 $a$ 随便）。","$f$ 偶 ⇒ $\\int_0^xf(t)\\,dt$ 奇（下限必须是 0）。"]}]},{"t":"box","kind":"why","label":"直觉","title":"","body":[{"t":"p","text":"积分会把函数「抹平」：$f$ 有台阶，$F$ 只是在那里拐个角（连续但不可导）；$f$ 拐角，$F$ 就光滑了。"},{"t":"p","text":"奇偶：奇函数左右面积相反，从 0 往左积和往右积得到一样的值，所以 $F$ 偶。"}]},{"t":"ex","title":"导函数在 0 处连续吗","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$g(x)=\\begin{cases}\\dfrac1x\\int_0^x\\sin t\\,dt,&x\\ne0\\\\0,&x=0\\end{cases}$。求 $g'(x)$，并判断 $g'$ 在 $x=0$ 处是否连续。"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"$x\\ne0$：$g(x)=\\dfrac{1-\\cos x}{x}$，$g'(x)=\\dfrac{x\\sin x-(1-\\cos x)}{x^2}$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$x=0$：不能代上面的式子，用定义：$g'(0)=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{g(x)-0}{x}=\\lim\\dfrac{1-\\cos x}{x^2}=\\dfrac12$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}g'(x)=\\lim\\dfrac{\\sin x}{x}-\\lim\\dfrac{1-\\cos x}{x^2}=1-\\dfrac12=\\dfrac12=g'(0)$，连续。"}]]},{"t":"box","kind":"warn","label":"易错","title":"","body":[{"t":"ul","items":["$x=0$ 处直接把 $x\\ne0$ 的导数式子代进去（分母是 0）。分段点一律用定义。","可去间断点处以为 $F'(x_0)=f(x_0)$。","$f$ 偶，下限不是 0 也说 $F$ 奇。"]}]},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"5-p1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$f(x)=\\begin{cases}1,&x\\le1\\\\2x,&x>1\\end{cases}$，$F(x)=\\int_0^xf(t)\\,dt$。$F$ 在 $x=1$ 处可导吗？"}],"options":{},"answer":"连续但不可导。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $f$ 有界，只有一个间断点，$F$ 连续。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $f(1^-)=1$，$f(1^+)=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to1^+}2x=2$，不相等，$x=1$ 是跳跃间断点。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $F$ 在 1 处左导数 $=f(1^-)=1$，右导数 $=f(1^+)=2$，不相等，不可导。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"变限积分在分段点：看 $f$ 在那一点是什么间断点，跳跃 ⇒ $F$ 不可导。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"直接算也行：$x\\le1$ 时 $F=x$；$x>1$ 时 $F=1+\\int_1^x2t\\,dt=x^2$。左导数 1，右导数 2。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"5-p2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$f(x)=\\begin{cases}x^2,&x\\ne1\\\\5,&x=1\\end{cases}$，$F(x)=\\int_0^xf(t)\\,dt$。求 $F'(1)$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$1$","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 积分不受一个点的值影响：$F(x)=\\int_0^xt^2\\,dt=\\dfrac{x^3}3$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $F'(1)=1^2=1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 对照方法框：可去间断点处 $F'(1)=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to1}f(x)=1$，不是 $f(1)=5$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"改一个点的函数值不改变积分 → $x=1$ 是 $f$ 的可去间断点，$F'(1)=\\lim f$，不是 $f(1)$。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"5-p3","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$f$ 是连续的偶函数，$F(x)=\\int_1^xf(t)\\,dt$ 一定是奇函数吗？"}],"options":{},"answer":"不一定。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 取最简单的偶函数 $f(x)=1$：$F(x)=\\int_1^x1\\,dt=x-1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $F(-x)=-x-1$，而 $-F(x)=-x+1$，不相等，$F$ 不是奇函数。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 原因：$\\int_1^xf=\\int_0^xf-\\int_0^1f$，多出来的常数 $-\\int_0^1f$ 破坏了奇性。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"「$f$ 偶 ⇒ $\\int_0^xf$ 奇」要求下限是 0；下限不是 0 就找反例。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"5-p4","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$F(x)=\\int_0^xt|t|\\,dt$ 是奇函数还是偶函数？"}],"options":{},"answer":"偶函数。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $f(t)=t|t|$，$f(-t)=-t\\,|-t|=-t|t|=-f(t)$，是奇函数。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 所以 $F(x)=\\int_0^xt|t|\\,dt$ 是偶函数。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 直接算对一下：$x\\ge0$ 时 $F=\\dfrac{x^3}3$；$x<0$ 时 $F=\\int_0^x(-t^2)\\,dt=-\\dfrac{x^3}3$。合起来 $F=\\dfrac{|x|^3}3$，偶函数。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"先判断被积函数的奇偶：$f$ 奇 ⇒ $\\int_0^xf$ 偶。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2013-03","src":{"year":2013,"no":3,"score":4,"type":"选择"},"type":"选择","q":[{"t":"p","text":"设函数 $f(x) = \\begin{cases} \\sin x, & 0 \\leqslant x < \\pi, \\\\ 2, & \\pi \\leqslant x \\leqslant 2\\pi, \\end{cases}$　$F(x) = \\int_0^x f(t)\\,dt$，则（　　）"}],"options":{"A":"$x = \\pi$ 是函数 $F(x)$ 的跳跃间断点","B":"$x = \\pi$ 是函数 $F(x)$ 的可去间断点","C":"$F(x)$ 在 $x = \\pi$ 处连续但不可导","D":"$F(x)$ 在 $x = \\pi$ 处可导"},"answer":"C","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"变限积分一定连续，A、B 先排除。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$f$ 在 $\\pi$ 处左极限 $\\sin\\pi=0$，右极限 2——是什么间断点？"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $f$ 在 $[0,2\\pi]$ 上有界，只有 $x=\\pi$ 一个间断点，所以 $F$ 连续，A、B 错。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $f(\\pi^-)=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to\\pi^-}\\sin x=0$，$f(\\pi^+)=2$，左右极限不相等，$x=\\pi$ 是 $f$ 的跳跃间断点。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $F$ 在 $\\pi$ 处左导数 $=f(\\pi^-)=0$，右导数 $=f(\\pi^+)=2$，不相等，不可导。选 C。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 直接算对一下：$x<\\pi$ 时 $F=1-\\cos x$；$x\\ge\\pi$ 时 $F=2+2(x-\\pi)$。两段在 $\\pi$ 处都等于 2（连续），斜率分别是 $\\sin\\pi=0$ 和 2（不可导）。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"变限积分一定连续（排除 A、B）；在分段点可不可导，看 $f$ 在那里是什么间断点。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"later","text":"2020 年以后本节还考过：2020-16（导函数在 0 处连续）、2024-3（奇偶性）。"},{"t":"recap","body":[{"t":"p","text":"变限积分 $F$ → 一定连续 → 在 $x_0$ 可不可导看 $f$：连续则 $F'=f$，跳跃则不可导，可去则 $F'=\\lim f$ → 分段点求导用定义 → 奇偶：$f$ 奇 ⇒ $F$ 偶；$f$ 偶且下限 0 ⇒ $F$ 奇。"}]}]},{"id":"6","label":"节6","title":"反常积分：先找坏点，能算就直接算","minutes":25,"kind":"","blocks":[{"t":"goal","text":"考法：选择题「下列反常积分收敛（发散）的是」，四个选项多数能直接求出原函数。2010–2019 年 3 道：2015-1、2016-3、2019-3。"},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"6-d1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int_1^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{dx}{x^2}$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$1$","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"$-\\dfrac1x\\Big|_1^{+\\infty}=0-(-1)=1$。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"6-d2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int_0^1\\dfrac{dx}{\\sqrt x}$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$2$","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"$x=0$ 处被积函数无界，是瑕点。$2\\sqrt x\\Big|_0^1=2$。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"h","text":"两种坏点"},{"t":"ul","items":["**无穷区间**：上限或下限是 $\\pm\\infty$。","**瑕点**：区间里（包括端点）被积函数无界的点。"]},{"t":"p","text":"反常积分 = 先在坏点前停下，算出积分，再取极限。极限存在就收敛，否则发散。"},{"t":"box","kind":"key","label":"方法","title":"判断敛散（能算的）","body":[{"t":"p","text":"① 列出**所有**坏点：无穷远、分母为 0 的点、$\\ln$ 的 0 点……区间中间的也算。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 有两个以上坏点：拆开，每段只含一个坏点，**每一段都收敛**整个才收敛。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 能写出原函数 $F$：直接看 $F$ 在坏点处的极限是不是有限数。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 基准（要背）：$\\int_1^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{dx}{x^p}$ 当 $p>1$ 收敛；$\\int_0^1\\dfrac{dx}{x^p}$ 当 $p<1$ 收敛。$p=1$ 两边都发散。（公式本：[[积分:pp|反常积分基准]]）"}]},{"t":"box","kind":"why","label":"直觉","title":"","body":[{"t":"p","text":"$\\int_1^N\\frac{dx}x=\\ln N$：$N$ 从 10 到 1000，积分只多了约 4.6，看起来涨得很慢，但永远涨，不收敛。$\\frac1{x^2}$ 掉得够快，面积加起来有限。"}]},{"t":"ex","title":"收敛","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{dx}{1+x^2}$。"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"两头都是无穷，拆成 $\\int_{-\\infty}^0+\\int_0^{+\\infty}$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$\\arctan x\\Big|_0^{+\\infty}=\\dfrac\\pi2$，$\\arctan x\\Big|_{-\\infty}^0=\\dfrac\\pi2$，收敛，值为 $\\pi$。"}]]},{"t":"ex","title":"奇函数的陷阱","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{x}{1+x^2}dx$ 收敛吗？"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"拆开：$\\int_0^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{x}{1+x^2}dx=\\dfrac12\\ln(1+x^2)\\Big|_0^{+\\infty}=+\\infty$，发散。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"有一段发散，整个就发散。不能用「奇函数在对称区间上积分为 0」——那条性质只对收敛的积分成立。"}]]},{"t":"box","kind":"warn","label":"易错","title":"","body":[{"t":"ul","items":["只看无穷远，漏了瑕点（或反过来）。","瑕点在区间中间，没发现，直接用牛顿–莱布尼茨公式，算出一个假的有限值。","两端都坏，合在一起算，正负抵消得到假的收敛。"]}]},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"6-p1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int_e^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{dx}{x\\ln^2x}$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$1$","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 令 $u=\\ln x$，$du=\\dfrac{dx}x$；$x=e$ 时 $u=1$，$x\\to+\\infty$ 时 $u\\to+\\infty$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $\\int_e^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{dx}{x\\ln^2x}=\\int_1^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{du}{u^2}=-\\dfrac1u\\Big|_1^{+\\infty}=0-(-1)=1$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"能写原函数就直接算：令 $u=\\ln x$，变成基准积分 $\\int\\frac{du}{u^2}$。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"6-p2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int_0^1\\ln x\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$-1$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"原函数 $x\\ln x-x$；$x\\to0^+$ 时 $x\\ln x\\to0$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 原函数（分部积分）：$\\int\\ln x\\,dx=x\\ln x-x+C$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $x\\to0^+$：$x\\ln x\\to0$（$x$ 趋于 0 比 $\\ln x$ 趋于无穷快），所以原函数 $\\to0$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $\\int_0^1\\ln x\\,dx=(1\\cdot0-1)-0=-1$，收敛。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"$x=0$ 处 $\\ln x\\to-\\infty$，是瑕点；原函数能写出来，直接看它在 $0^+$ 处的极限。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"6-p3","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\int_1^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{dx}{x(1+x)}$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\ln2$","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $\\dfrac1{x(1+x)}=\\dfrac1x-\\dfrac1{1+x}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 原函数 $\\ln x-\\ln(1+x)=\\ln\\dfrac{x}{1+x}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $x\\to+\\infty$ 时 $\\dfrac x{1+x}\\to1$，$\\ln\\dfrac x{1+x}\\to0$；$x=1$ 时为 $\\ln\\dfrac12$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 积分 $=0-\\ln\\dfrac12=\\ln2$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"有理函数 → 拆成部分分式写原函数，再看 $+\\infty$ 处的极限。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"拆成 $\\int_1^{+\\infty}\\frac{dx}x-\\int_1^{+\\infty}\\frac{dx}{1+x}$ 分开算是错的：两个都发散，「$\\infty-\\infty$」没有意义。要先合成一个原函数再取极限。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"6-p4","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"有人算 $\\int_{-1}^1\\dfrac{dx}{x^2}=-\\dfrac1x\\Big|_{-1}^1=-2$。错在哪？"}],"options":{},"answer":"$x=0$ 是瑕点，积分发散。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 一眼看出不对：被积函数 $\\dfrac1{x^2}>0$，积分不可能是负数。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $x=0$ 在 $(-1,1)$ 中间，是瑕点。拆成 $\\int_{-1}^0+\\int_0^1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $\\int_0^1\\dfrac{dx}{x^2}$：$x=0$ 附近 $p=2\\ge1$，发散。有一段发散，整个就发散。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"先列坏点：$\\frac1{x^2}$ 在区间中间的 $x=0$ 处无界。瑕点在中间时不能直接用牛顿–莱布尼茨公式。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2015-01","src":{"year":2015,"no":1,"score":4,"type":"选择"},"type":"选择","q":[{"t":"p","text":"下列反常积分中收敛的是（　　）"}],"options":{"A":"$\\int_2^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}\\,dx$","B":"$\\int_2^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{\\ln x}{x}\\,dx$","C":"$\\int_2^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{1}{x\\ln x}\\,dx$","D":"$\\int_2^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{x}{e^x}\\,dx$"},"answer":"D","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"四个都能写原函数：A 是 $2\\sqrt x$，B 是 $\\frac12\\ln^2x$，C 是 $\\ln\\ln x$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① A：原函数 $2\\sqrt x\\to+\\infty$，发散。"},{"t":"p","text":"② B：$\\dfrac{\\ln x}{x}=\\ln x\\cdot(\\ln x)'$，原函数 $\\dfrac12\\ln^2x\\to+\\infty$，发散。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ C：$\\dfrac{1}{x\\ln x}=\\dfrac{(\\ln x)'}{\\ln x}$，原函数 $\\ln\\ln x\\to+\\infty$，发散（涨得很慢，但一直涨）。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ D：分部积分 $\\int xe^{-x}dx=-(x+1)e^{-x}$；$x\\to+\\infty$ 时 $\\to0$，收敛，值为 $0-(-3e^{-2})=3e^{-2}$。选 D。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"四个选项都能写出原函数 → 逐个看原函数在 $+\\infty$ 处的极限是不是有限数。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"C 是 $\\frac1{x\\ln^qx}$ 型 $q=1$ 的临界情形：$q=1$ 发散，$q>1$ 才收敛（节7）。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2016-03","src":{"year":2016,"no":3,"score":4,"type":"选择"},"type":"选择","q":[{"t":"p","text":"反常积分 ① $\\int_{-\\infty}^{0}\\dfrac{1}{x^2}e^{\\frac{1}{x}}\\,dx$，② $\\int_{0}^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{1}{x^2}e^{\\frac{1}{x}}\\,dx$ 的敛散性为（　　）"}],"options":{"A":"① 收敛，② 收敛","B":"① 收敛，② 发散","C":"① 发散，② 收敛","D":"① 发散，② 发散"},"answer":"B","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"$\\left(e^{\\frac1x}\\right)'=-\\dfrac1{x^2}e^{\\frac1x}$，原函数是 $-e^{\\frac1x}$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"两个积分在 $x=0$ 处都是瑕点：$x\\to0^-$ 和 $x\\to0^+$ 时 $e^{\\frac1x}$ 各趋于什么？"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 原函数：$\\left(e^{\\frac1x}\\right)'=e^{\\frac1x}\\cdot\\left(-\\dfrac1{x^2}\\right)$，所以 $\\int\\dfrac1{x^2}e^{\\frac1x}dx=-e^{\\frac1x}+C$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② ①：$x\\to0^-$ 时 $\\frac1x\\to-\\infty$，$-e^{\\frac1x}\\to0$；$x\\to-\\infty$ 时 $\\frac1x\\to0$，$-e^{\\frac1x}\\to-1$。积分 $=0-(-1)=1$，收敛。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ ②：$x\\to0^+$ 时 $\\frac1x\\to+\\infty$，$-e^{\\frac1x}\\to-\\infty$，发散。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 选 B。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"两个积分在 $x=0$ 处都是瑕点（$\\frac1{x^2}$ 无界），① 另一头是 $-\\infty$，② 另一头是 $+\\infty$。原函数能写出来，直接看两头的极限。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"$0^-$ 和 $0^+$ 一定分开算：$e^{\\frac1x}$ 在两侧一个趋于 0、一个趋于无穷。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2019-03","src":{"year":2019,"no":3,"score":4,"type":"选择"},"type":"选择","q":[{"t":"p","text":"下列反常积分发散的是（　　）"}],"options":{"A":"$\\int_0^{+\\infty} xe^{-x}\\,dx$","B":"$\\int_0^{+\\infty} xe^{-x^2}\\,dx$","C":"$\\int_0^{+\\infty} \\dfrac{\\arctan x}{1 + x^2}\\,dx$","D":"$\\int_0^{+\\infty} \\dfrac{x}{1 + x^2}\\,dx$"},"answer":"D","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"D 的原函数是 $\\frac12\\ln(1+x^2)$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① A：$\\int xe^{-x}dx=-(x+1)e^{-x}$，$\\Big|_0^{+\\infty}=0-(-1)=1$，收敛。"},{"t":"p","text":"② B：$\\int xe^{-x^2}dx=-\\dfrac12e^{-x^2}$，$\\Big|_0^{+\\infty}=\\dfrac12$，收敛。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ C：$\\dfrac{\\arctan x}{1+x^2}=\\arctan x\\cdot(\\arctan x)'$，原函数 $\\dfrac12\\arctan^2x$，$\\Big|_0^{+\\infty}=\\dfrac12\\cdot\\dfrac{\\pi^2}4=\\dfrac{\\pi^2}8$，收敛。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ D：原函数 $\\dfrac12\\ln(1+x^2)\\to+\\infty$，发散。选 D。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"四个都能写原函数，逐个看 $+\\infty$ 处的极限。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"不算也能判断 D：$x\\to+\\infty$ 时 $\\dfrac{x}{1+x^2}\\sim\\dfrac1x$，$p=1$，发散。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"recap","body":[{"t":"p","text":"反常积分 → 列出所有坏点（无穷远 + 瑕点，区间中间的也算）→ 多个坏点就拆开，每段都收敛才收敛 → 能写原函数就直接看极限 → 基准：无穷远要 $p>1$，0 附近要 $p<1$。"}]}]},{"id":"7","label":"节7","title":"反常积分：算不出来就和 1/xᵖ 比","minutes":40,"kind":"","blocks":[{"t":"goal","text":"考法：选择题「含参数的反常积分收敛，求参数范围」「收敛性和哪些参数有关」。2010–2019 年 2 道：2010-4、2013-4；2020 年以后又考了 3 道。"},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"7-d1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$\\int_1^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{dx}{x^2+x+1}$ 收敛吗？"}],"options":{},"answer":"收敛。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"$x\\to+\\infty$ 时被积函数 $\\sim\\dfrac1{x^2}$，$p=2>1$。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"诊断","id":"7-d2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$\\int_0^1\\dfrac{dx}{\\sin x}$ 收敛吗？"}],"options":{},"answer":"发散。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"$x=0$ 是瑕点，$\\sin x\\sim x$，被积函数 $\\sim\\dfrac1x$，$p=1$，发散。"}],"idea":[],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"h","text":"只看坏点附近长什么样"},{"t":"p","text":"收不收敛只取决于坏点附近，离坏点远的部分是普通的定积分，有限。所以：在每个坏点附近，用等价把被积函数化成 $\\dfrac{C}{x^p}$（或 $\\dfrac{C}{(x-a)^p}$），再查基准。"},{"t":"box","kind":"key","label":"方法","title":"比较判别（极限形式）","body":[{"t":"p","text":"① 列坏点，拆开，每段一个坏点。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 每个坏点附近找等价：$f(x)\\sim\\dfrac{C}{x^p}$（$C\\ne0$），$f$ 和 $\\dfrac1{x^p}$ 同敛散。"},{"t":"p","text":"无穷远：$p>1$ 收敛。"},{"t":"p","text":"$x=0$ 附近：$p<1$ 收敛。瑕点在 $a$：看 $\\dfrac1{|x-a|^p}$，同样 $p<1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 每个坏点得一个条件，**取交集**。"}]},{"t":"box","kind":"key","label":"方法","title":"对数因子","body":[{"t":"ul","items":["幂次不在临界值时，$\\ln$ 不改变结论：$\\int_1^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{\\ln x}{x^2}dx$ 收敛，$\\int_0^1\\dfrac{\\ln x}{\\sqrt x}dx$ 收敛。","幂次正好在临界值时，$\\ln$ 决定结论：$\\int_2^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{dx}{x\\ln^qx}$ 当 $q>1$ 收敛（令 $u=\\ln x$ 就变成 $\\int\\frac{du}{u^q}$）。","$\\ln x$ 在 $x=1$ 附近：$\\ln x\\sim x-1$。"]}]},{"t":"ex","title":"两个坏点 + 参数","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$\\int_0^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{dx}{x^p(1+x)}$ 收敛，求 $p$ 的范围。"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"坏点：$x=0$（$p>0$ 时）和 $+\\infty$。拆成 $\\int_0^1+\\int_1^{+\\infty}$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$x\\to0^+$：$\\dfrac1{x^p(1+x)}\\sim\\dfrac1{x^p}$，要 $p<1$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$x\\to+\\infty$：$\\sim\\dfrac1{x^{p+1}}$，要 $p+1>1$，即 $p>0$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"取交集：$0<p<1$。"}]]},{"t":"ex","title":"对数不在临界","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$\\int_0^1\\dfrac{\\ln x}{\\sqrt x}dx$ 收敛吗？"}],"steps":[[{"t":"p","text":"$x=0$ 是瑕点。$\\frac1{\\sqrt x}$ 是 $p=\\frac12<1$，不在临界值 1 上。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$|\\ln x|$ 比任何负幂都小：$x^{\\frac14}|\\ln x|\\to0$，所以 $x\\to0^+$ 时 $\\left|\\dfrac{\\ln x}{\\sqrt x}\\right|\\le\\dfrac{1}{x^{3/4}}$，$p=\\frac34<1$，收敛。"}]]},{"t":"box","kind":"warn","label":"易错","title":"","body":[{"t":"ul","items":["两个坏点只查了一个。","两个条件没取交集，写成了并集。","把两个方向的基准记反：无穷远是 $p>1$，0 附近是 $p<1$。","$p$ 正好等于临界值时，$\\ln$ 因子被当成没影响。"]}]},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"7-p1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$\\int_1^{+\\infty}\\sin\\dfrac1x\\,dx$ 收敛吗？"}],"options":{},"answer":"发散。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 唯一的坏点是 $+\\infty$（$\\sin\\frac1x$ 在 $[1,+\\infty)$ 上有界）。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $x\\to+\\infty$ 时 $\\frac1x\\to0$，$\\sin\\dfrac1x\\sim\\dfrac1x$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 和 $\\int_1^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{dx}x$ 同敛散，$p=1$，发散。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"原函数写不出来 → 看坏点 $+\\infty$ 附近被积函数等价于哪个 $\\frac1{x^p}$。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"7-p2","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$\\int_0^{\\frac\\pi2}\\dfrac{dx}{\\sqrt{\\sin x}}$ 收敛吗？"}],"options":{},"answer":"收敛。","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $x\\to0^+$：$\\sin x\\sim x$，$\\sqrt{\\sin x}\\sim\\sqrt x$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 被积函数 $\\sim\\dfrac1{x^{1/2}}$，$p=\\frac12<1$，收敛。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $x=\\frac\\pi2$ 处 $\\sin x=1$，不是坏点。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"坏点是 $x=0$（$\\sin x\\to0$，被积函数无界）→ 等价成 $\\frac1{x^p}$，看 $p<1$。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"7-p3","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$\\int_0^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{x^a}{1+x^2}dx$ 收敛，求 $a$ 的范围。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$-1<a<1$","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 拆成 $\\int_0^1+\\int_1^{+\\infty}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $x\\to0^+$：$1+x^2\\to1$，被积函数 $\\sim x^a=\\dfrac1{x^{-a}}$，要 $-a<1$，即 $a>-1$。（$a\\ge0$ 时 0 根本不是瑕点，也满足。）"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $x\\to+\\infty$：被积函数 $\\sim\\dfrac{x^a}{x^2}=\\dfrac1{x^{2-a}}$，要 $2-a>1$，即 $a<1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 取交集：$-1<a<1$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"两个可能的坏点：$x=0$（$a<0$ 时无界）和 $+\\infty$ → 拆开各得一个条件，取交集。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"7-p4","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$\\int_2^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{dx}{x\\ln^qx}$ 收敛，求 $q$ 的范围。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$q>1$","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 令 $u=\\ln x$，$du=\\dfrac{dx}x$；$x=2$ 时 $u=\\ln2$，$x\\to+\\infty$ 时 $u\\to+\\infty$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 原积分 $=\\int_{\\ln2}^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{du}{u^q}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $\\ln2>0$，下限不是坏点；无穷远处 $\\dfrac1{u^q}$ 收敛要 $q>1$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"$\\frac{1}{x\\ln^qx}$ 是幂次正好在临界值 $p=1$ 的情形，由 $\\ln$ 的次数决定 → 令 $u=\\ln x$ 变成基准积分。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"7-p5","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$\\int_0^1\\dfrac{dx}{x^a(1-x)^b}$ 收敛，求 $a$、$b$ 的范围（$a,b>0$）。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$0<a<1$ 且 $0<b<1$","hints":[],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 拆成 $\\int_0^{\\frac12}+\\int_{\\frac12}^1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $x\\to0^+$：$(1-x)^b\\to1$，被积函数 $\\sim\\dfrac1{x^a}$，要 $a<1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $x\\to1^-$：$x^a\\to1$，被积函数 $\\sim\\dfrac1{(1-x)^b}$，要 $b<1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 两个条件同时成立：$0<a<1$ 且 $0<b<1$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"两个瑕点 $x=0$、$x=1$ → 拆开，每个瑕点附近只有一个因子起作用，各得一个条件。"}],"note":[],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2013-04","src":{"year":2013,"no":4,"score":4,"type":"选择"},"type":"选择","q":[{"t":"p","text":"设函数 $f(x) = \\begin{cases} \\dfrac{1}{(x-1)^{\\alpha-1}}, & 1 < x < e, \\\\ \\dfrac{1}{x\\ln^{\\alpha+1} x}, & x \\geqslant e, \\end{cases}$　若反常积分 $\\int_1^{+\\infty} f(x)\\,dx$ 收敛，则（　　）"}],"options":{"A":"$\\alpha < -2$","B":"$\\alpha > 2$","C":"$-2 < \\alpha < 0$","D":"$0 < \\alpha < 2$"},"answer":"D","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"两个坏点：$x=1$（瑕点）和 $+\\infty$。拆成 $\\int_1^e+\\int_e^{+\\infty}$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$x=1$ 附近是 $\\frac1{(x-1)^p}$ 型，$p=\\alpha-1$；$+\\infty$ 处是 $\\frac1{x\\ln^qx}$ 型，$q=\\alpha+1$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① $\\int_1^e\\dfrac{dx}{(x-1)^{\\alpha-1}}$：瑕点 $x=1$，是 $\\dfrac1{(x-1)^p}$ 型，$p=\\alpha-1$，收敛要 $\\alpha-1<1$，即 $\\alpha<2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $\\int_e^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{dx}{x\\ln^{\\alpha+1}x}$：令 $u=\\ln x$，$=\\int_1^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{du}{u^{\\alpha+1}}$，收敛要 $\\alpha+1>1$，即 $\\alpha>0$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 取交集 $0<\\alpha<2$，选 D。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"两个坏点：$x=1$（瑕点）和 $+\\infty$ → 拆成 $\\int_1^e+\\int_e^{+\\infty}$，两段各套一个基准，条件取交集。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"$\\alpha\\le1$ 时第一段 $p=\\alpha-1\\le0$，$x=1$ 根本不是瑕点；条件 $\\alpha<2$ 照样成立，不影响结论。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"q","kind":"真题","id":"z2010-04","src":{"year":2010,"no":4,"score":4,"type":"选择"},"type":"选择","q":[{"t":"p","text":"设 $m,n$ 均是正整数，则反常积分 $\\int_0^1\\dfrac{\\sqrt[m]{\\ln^2(1-x)}}{\\sqrt[n]{x}}\\,dx$ 的收敛性（　　）"}],"options":{"A":"仅与 $m$ 的取值有关","B":"仅与 $n$ 的取值有关","C":"与 $m,n$ 的取值都有关","D":"与 $m,n$ 的取值都无关"},"answer":"D","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"两个可能的瑕点：$x=0$ 和 $x=1$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$x\\to0^+$：$\\ln(1-x)\\sim-x$，被积函数 $\\sim\\dfrac{x^{2/m}}{x^{1/n}}$。$x\\to1^-$：分母 $\\to1$，只剩 $|\\ln(1-x)|^{2/m}$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 拆成 $\\int_0^{\\frac12}+\\int_{\\frac12}^1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $x\\to0^+$：$\\ln(1-x)\\sim-x$，$\\ln^2(1-x)\\sim x^2$，被积函数 $\\sim\\dfrac{x^{2/m}}{x^{1/n}}=\\dfrac{1}{x^{\\frac1n-\\frac2m}}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $\\frac1n\\le1$，$\\frac2m>0$，所以 $\\frac1n-\\frac2m<1$，对所有正整数 $m,n$ 都收敛。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ $x\\to1^-$：$\\sqrt[n]x\\to1$，被积函数 $\\sim|\\ln(1-x)|^{\\frac2m}$。对数比任何负幂都小：$(1-x)^{\\frac12}|\\ln(1-x)|^{\\frac2m}\\to0$，所以 $x$ 靠近 1 时被积函数 $\\le\\dfrac{1}{(1-x)^{1/2}}$，$p=\\frac12<1$，收敛。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑤ 两处对所有 $m,n$ 都收敛，选 D。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"两个可能的瑕点：$x=0$（分母 $\\sqrt[n]x\\to0$）和 $x=1$（$\\ln(1-x)\\to-\\infty$）→ 分别等价，看是否对所有 $m,n$ 都收敛。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"「对数比任何负幂都小」是处理 $\\ln$ 型瑕点的通用一招：乘一个小幂次后极限为 0，就能和 $\\frac1{(1-x)^{1/2}}$ 比。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":""},{"t":"later","text":"2020 年以后本节还考过：2022-5、2024-7（命题判断，要会举反例）、2026-11。"},{"t":"recap","body":[{"t":"p","text":"算不出原函数 → 列坏点、拆开 → 每个坏点附近等价成 $\\frac C{x^p}$ → 无穷远 $p>1$、0 附近 $p<1$ 收敛 → $\\ln$ 只在临界 $p=1$ 时起作用 → 条件取交集。"}]}]},{"id":"zf","label":"总复习","title":"方法地图 · 题眼 · 混合自测","minutes":50,"kind":"review","blocks":[{"t":"p","text":"这一讲的题大多是 4–5 分的小题，拼的是**认题快**：看到题目几秒内知道它属于哪一节、第一步做什么。下面先过每节的方法，再练反应，最后做一组不告诉你节号的混合题。"},{"t":"cards","items":[["$\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}$ 后面是一串 $n$ 项的和","从每项里提出一个 $\\frac1n$，剩下的写成 $f\\left(\\frac kn\\right)$，化成 $\\int_0^1f(x)\\,dx$"],["和式的 $k$ 一直加到 $2n$","区间变成 $[0,2]$，不是 $[0,1]$"],["$n$ 项的乘积再开 $n$ 次方","先取对数，乘积变和，再化积分"],["比较几个积分的大小","先别算：同一个区间就比被积函数；上限不同就拆区间，看多出来那段的正负"],["对称区间 $[-a,a]$ 上的积分","被积函数先拆成奇 + 偶，奇的部分直接是 0"],["周期为 $T$ 的函数，在长 $T$ 的区间上积分","和 $\\int_0^Tf$ 相等，区间可以随便平移"],["题目说「平均值」","$\\frac1{b-a}\\int_a^bf(x)\\,dx$"],["$f$ 是求不出来的变限积分，要算 $\\int f$","分部积分，把求导落到 $f$ 上：$f'$ 就是被积函数"],["要证有零点，条件里有积分","积分中值定理：$\\int_a^bf=f(\\xi)(b-a)$"],["变限积分求导，被积函数里有 $x$","先把 $x$ 提出去，或换元（$u=x-t$、$u=xt$、$u=x^2-t^2$）把 $x$ 移到上限"],["方程里有 $\\int_0^xf(t)\\,dt$","两边求导把积分消掉；再令 $x=0$ 拿初值"],["被积函数在 $x_0$ 处跳一下","变限积分在 $x_0$ 连续但不可导（左右导数是左右极限）"],["分段点上问导数","用导数定义单独算，不能把 $x\\ne0$ 的导数式子代进去"],["$f$ 奇，问 $\\int_0^xf$ 的奇偶","偶函数；$f$ 偶时 $\\int_0^xf$ 是奇函数（下限必须是 0）"],["判断反常积分收不收敛","先列出所有坏点（无穷远、分母为 0 的点），拆开，每段都收敛才收敛"],["原函数一眼能写出来","直接看原函数在坏点的极限是不是有限数"],["原函数写不出来","坏点附近等价成 $\\frac1{x^p}$：无穷远要 $p>1$，0 附近要 $p<1$"],["幂次正好卡在 1，还带着 $\\ln$","$\\ln$ 决定结论：$\\int_2^{+\\infty}\\frac{dx}{x\\ln^qx}$ 要 $q>1$"]]},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"zf-p1","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\sum\\limits_{k=1}^{n}\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{4n^2-k^2}}$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\dfrac\\pi6$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"每项提出 $\\frac1n$：$\\sqrt{4n^2-k^2}=n\\sqrt{4-(k/n)^2}$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"化成 $\\int_0^1\\dfrac{dx}{\\sqrt{4-x^2}}$，原函数是 $\\arcsin\\dfrac x2$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 先把每一项整理出 $\\frac1n$。根号里提出 $n^2$：$\\sqrt{4n^2-k^2}=\\sqrt{n^2\\left(4-\\frac{k^2}{n^2}\\right)}=n\\sqrt{4-\\left(\\frac kn\\right)^2}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 所以第 $k$ 项 $=\\dfrac{1}{n\\sqrt{4-(k/n)^2}}=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{4-(k/n)^2}}\\cdot\\dfrac1n$。把 $\\frac kn$ 换成 $x$，读出 $f(x)=\\dfrac1{\\sqrt{4-x^2}}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $k$ 从 1 加到 $n$，$\\frac kn$ 从 $\\frac1n$ 走到 1，区间是 $[0,1]$：原式 $=\\int_0^1\\dfrac{dx}{\\sqrt{4-x^2}}$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ $\\int\\dfrac{dx}{\\sqrt{a^2-x^2}}=\\arcsin\\dfrac xa+C$，这里 $a=2$：$\\arcsin\\dfrac x2\\Big|_0^1=\\arcsin\\dfrac12-0=\\dfrac\\pi6$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"$n\\to\\infty$ 时一串 $n$ 项相加，而且每一项都能写成「$\\frac kn$ 的函数 × $\\frac1n$」→ 定积分定义。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"根号、分母里的 $n^2$ 和 $k^2$ 同时出现，都是「提出 $n$」的信号；提出来以后一定要检查剩下的只含 $\\frac kn$。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":"1"},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"zf-p2","src":null,"type":"选择","q":[{"t":"p","text":"设 $I_1=\\int_0^1\\dfrac{x}{1+x}dx$，$I_2=\\int_0^1\\ln(1+x)\\,dx$，则（　　）"}],"options":{"A":"$I_1<I_2<\\dfrac12$","B":"$I_2<I_1<\\dfrac12$","C":"$\\dfrac12<I_1<I_2$","D":"$I_1<\\dfrac12<I_2$"},"answer":"A","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"同一个区间，比被积函数 $\\dfrac x{1+x}$、$\\ln(1+x)$、$x$ 的大小（$\\frac12=\\int_0^1x\\,dx$）。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$x>0$ 时 $\\dfrac{x}{1+x}<\\ln(1+x)<x$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 把 $\\frac12$ 也写成同一区间上的积分：$\\frac12=\\int_0^1x\\,dx$。现在三个积分区间相同，只要比较 $\\dfrac{x}{1+x}$、$\\ln(1+x)$、$x$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 右边：$x>0$ 时 $\\ln(1+x)<x$（常用不等式）。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 左边：令 $g(x)=\\ln(1+x)-\\dfrac{x}{1+x}$，$g(0)=0$，$g'(x)=\\dfrac1{1+x}-\\dfrac{1}{(1+x)^2}=\\dfrac{x}{(1+x)^2}>0$，所以 $x>0$ 时 $g(x)>0$，即 $\\dfrac x{1+x}<\\ln(1+x)$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 在 $(0,1)$ 上 $\\dfrac x{1+x}<\\ln(1+x)<x$，积分保持大小：$I_1<I_2<\\dfrac12$，选 A。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑤ 对一下数值：$I_1=1-\\ln2\\approx0.307$，$I_2=2\\ln2-1\\approx0.386$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"三个数都是 $[0,1]$ 上的积分（$\\frac12$ 写成 $\\int_0^1x\\,dx$）→ 不用算，比被积函数。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"$\\dfrac{x}{1+x}<\\ln(1+x)<x$（$x>0$）这一串要背下来，比较积分、证不等式都常用。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":"2"},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"zf-p3","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$f$ 连续，$F(x)=\\int_0^{x}tf(x^2-t^2)\\,dt$，求 $F'(x)$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$F'(x)=xf(x^2)$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"被积函数里有 $x$，先换元把 $x$ 赶到上限：令 $u=x^2-t^2$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$du=-2t\\,dt$，$t=0$ 时 $u=x^2$，$t=x$ 时 $u=0$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 令 $u=x^2-t^2$（积分时 $x$ 当常数），则 $du=-2t\\,dt$，即 $t\\,dt=-\\dfrac12du$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 换积分限：$t=0$ 时 $u=x^2$；$t=x$ 时 $u=0$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $F(x)=\\int_{x^2}^{0}f(u)\\left(-\\dfrac12\\right)du=\\dfrac12\\int_0^{x^2}f(u)\\,du$。现在被积函数里没有 $x$ 了。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 套变限积分求导公式（上限是 $x^2$，要乘上限的导数 $2x$）：$F'(x)=\\dfrac12f(x^2)\\cdot2x=xf(x^2)$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"变限积分求导，但被积函数 $f(x^2-t^2)$ 里有 $x$ → 不能直接套公式，先换元让 $x$ 只出现在积分限上。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"被积函数里 $x$、$t$ 搅在一起时，换元的目标只有一个：换完以后被积函数里只剩积分变量。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":"4"},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"zf-p4","src":null,"type":"选择","q":[{"t":"p","text":"设 $f(x)$ 连续，下列函数中必为偶函数的是（　　）"}],"options":{"A":"$\\int_0^xf(t^2)\\,dt$","B":"$\\int_0^xf^2(t)\\,dt$","C":"$\\int_0^xt\\left[f(t)-f(-t)\\right]dt$","D":"$\\int_0^xt\\left[f(t)+f(-t)\\right]dt$"},"answer":"D","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"规律：被积函数是奇函数，$\\int_0^x$ 就是偶函数；被积函数是偶函数，$\\int_0^x$ 是奇函数。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"逐个判断被积函数的奇偶：$f(t)+f(-t)$ 是偶函数，乘上 $t$ 呢？"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 规律回顾：被积函数 $g$ 是奇函数时，$\\int_0^xg(t)\\,dt$ 是偶函数；$g$ 是偶函数时，$\\int_0^xg(t)\\,dt$ 是奇函数。所以要找被积函数**必为奇函数**的那个。"},{"t":"p","text":"② A：$f(t^2)$ 把 $t$ 换成 $-t$ 不变，是偶函数，积出来是奇函数。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ B：$f^2(t)$ 的奇偶由 $f$ 决定，$f$ 是一般函数时没有奇偶性，不选。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ C：$h(t)=f(t)-f(-t)$ 满足 $h(-t)=f(-t)-f(t)=-h(t)$，是奇函数；$t\\cdot h(t)$ 是奇 × 奇 = 偶，积出来是奇函数。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑤ D：$f(t)+f(-t)$ 是偶函数，$t\\cdot[\\,\\cdots]$ 是奇 × 偶 = 奇，积出来是偶函数。选 D。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"问 $\\int_0^x(\\cdots)$ 的奇偶 → 转成问被积函数的奇偶（奇 → 偶，偶 → 奇）。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"$f(t)+f(-t)$ 一定偶、$f(t)-f(-t)$ 一定奇——不管 $f$ 自己有没有奇偶性。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":"5"},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"zf-p5","src":null,"type":"选择","q":[{"t":"p","text":"下列反常积分收敛的是（　　）"}],"options":{"A":"$\\int_1^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{dx}{\\sqrt x\\,(1+x)}$","B":"$\\int_0^{1}\\dfrac{dx}{x-x^2}$","C":"$\\int_1^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{\\ln x}{x}dx$","D":"$\\int_0^{1}\\dfrac{dx}{\\sqrt[3]{x^2}\\,(1-x)}$"},"answer":"A","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"先给每个积分找坏点：A 是 $+\\infty$；B、D 的端点 0 和 1 都可能是瑕点。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"每个坏点附近化成 $\\frac1{x^p}$（或 $\\frac1{(1-x)^p}$）比较。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① A：只有一个坏点 $+\\infty$。$x\\to+\\infty$ 时 $\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt x(1+x)}\\sim\\dfrac1{x^{3/2}}$，$p=\\frac32>1$，收敛。"},{"t":"p","text":"② B：$x-x^2=x(1-x)$，两端都是瑕点。$x\\to0^+$ 时被积函数 $\\sim\\dfrac1x$，$p=1$，发散。一个坏点发散就够了。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ C：原函数 $\\dfrac12\\ln^2x\\to+\\infty$，发散。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ D：$x=1$ 处 $\\sqrt[3]{x^2}\\to1$，被积函数 $\\sim\\dfrac1{1-x}$，$p=1$，发散（$x=0$ 处 $\\sim x^{-2/3}$ 是收敛的，但没用）。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑤ 只有 A 收敛。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"判断收敛 → 列坏点、拆开、每个坏点等价成 $p$ 积分；只要有一个坏点发散，整个就发散。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"两个坏点的题，只要找到一个发散的就可以停；要说明收敛，就得每个坏点都查过。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":"7"},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"zf-p6","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"反常积分 $\\int_0^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{\\ln(1+x)}{x^p}dx$ 收敛，求 $p$ 的取值范围。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$1<p<2$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"两个坏点：$x=0$（$\\ln(1+x)\\sim x$）和 $+\\infty$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$x\\to0^+$ 时被积函数 $\\sim\\dfrac1{x^{p-1}}$；$+\\infty$ 处有 $\\ln$，幂次要严格大于 1。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 拆成 $\\int_0^1+\\int_1^{+\\infty}$，分别看。"},{"t":"p","text":"② $x\\to0^+$：$\\ln(1+x)\\sim x$，被积函数 $\\sim\\dfrac{x}{x^p}=\\dfrac1{x^{p-1}}$。0 附近收敛要 $p-1<1$，即 $p<2$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $x\\to+\\infty$：被积函数 $=\\dfrac{\\ln(1+x)}{x^p}$。若 $p>1$，取 $1<q<p$，$\\dfrac{\\ln(1+x)}{x^p}=\\dfrac{\\ln(1+x)}{x^{p-q}}\\cdot\\dfrac1{x^q}$，前一个因子 $\\to0$，所以比 $\\dfrac1{x^q}$ 还小，收敛。若 $p\\le1$，$x\\ge e$ 时 $\\dfrac{\\ln(1+x)}{x^p}\\ge\\dfrac1{x}$，发散。所以要 $p>1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 取交集：$1<p<2$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"含参数、两个坏点 → 拆开，各自等价成 $p$ 积分得一个条件，最后取交集。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"无穷远处有 $\\ln$ 时，幂次大于 1 就收敛、小于等于 1 就发散——$\\ln$ 只在幂次正好是 1 的时候才「说了算」，而这里 $\\ln$ 在分子上，$p=1$ 时也发散。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":"7"},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"zf-p7","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"$f(x)=\\int_x^{1}\\dfrac{\\sin t}{t}dt$，求 $\\int_0^1f(x)\\,dx$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$1-\\cos1$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"$f$ 求不出来，对 $\\int_0^1f(x)\\,dx$ 分部积分：$u=f(x)$，$dv=dx$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$f(1)=0$，$f'(x)=-\\dfrac{\\sin x}{x}$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 分部：$\\int_0^1f(x)\\,dx=xf(x)\\Big|_0^1-\\int_0^1xf'(x)\\,dx$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 边界项：$x=1$ 时 $f(1)=\\int_1^1(\\cdots)=0$；$x=0$ 时前面乘着 0。边界项为 0。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ $f'(x)=-\\dfrac{\\sin x}{x}$（下限是 $x$，求导带负号）。所以 $-\\int_0^1xf'(x)\\,dx=\\int_0^1x\\cdot\\dfrac{\\sin x}xdx=\\int_0^1\\sin x\\,dx$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ $\\int_0^1\\sin x\\,dx=-\\cos x\\Big|_0^1=1-\\cos1$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"被积函数 $f$ 是求不出来的变限积分 → 分部积分，把求导交给 $f$，$f'$ 就是原来的被积函数。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"和节3 的公式 $\\int_0^bf=\\int_0^b(b-t)g(t)\\,dt$ 是同一件事，只是这里 $f$ 的变限在下限。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":"3"},{"t":"q","kind":"练习","id":"zf-p8","src":null,"type":"","q":[{"t":"p","text":"求 $\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\dfrac1n\\sqrt[n]{(n+1)(n+2)\\cdots(2n)}$。"}],"options":{},"answer":"$\\dfrac4e$","hints":[[{"t":"p","text":"记原式为 $a_n$，取对数：$\\ln a_n=\\dfrac1n\\sum\\limits_{k=1}^{n}\\ln(n+k)-\\ln n$。"}],[{"t":"p","text":"$\\ln(n+k)-\\ln n=\\ln\\left(1+\\dfrac kn\\right)$，化成 $\\int_0^1\\ln(1+x)\\,dx=2\\ln2-1$。"}]],"sol":[{"t":"p","text":"① 设 $a_n=\\dfrac1n\\sqrt[n]{(n+1)(n+2)\\cdots(2n)}$。取对数：$\\ln a_n=\\dfrac1n\\sum\\limits_{k=1}^{n}\\ln(n+k)-\\ln n$。"},{"t":"p","text":"② 把 $\\ln n$ 写成 $\\dfrac1n\\sum\\limits_{k=1}^n\\ln n$，和前面合并：$\\ln a_n=\\dfrac1n\\sum\\limits_{k=1}^{n}\\left[\\ln(n+k)-\\ln n\\right]=\\dfrac1n\\sum\\limits_{k=1}^{n}\\ln\\left(1+\\dfrac kn\\right)$。"},{"t":"p","text":"③ 这就是 $f(x)=\\ln(1+x)$ 的和式：$\\ln a_n\\to\\int_0^1\\ln(1+x)\\,dx$。"},{"t":"p","text":"④ 分部积分（第9讲）：$\\int\\ln(1+x)\\,dx=(1+x)\\ln(1+x)-x+C$，所以 $\\int_0^1\\ln(1+x)\\,dx=2\\ln2-1$。"},{"t":"p","text":"⑤ $a_n\\to e^{2\\ln2-1}=\\dfrac{e^{2\\ln2}}{e}=\\dfrac4e$。"}],"idea":[{"t":"p","text":"$n$ 项相乘再开 $n$ 次方 → 取对数把乘积变成和，再用定积分定义。"}],"note":[{"t":"p","text":"「乘积开 $n$ 次方」几乎都是这个套路：取对数 → 和式 → 定积分 → 最后别忘了指数回去。"}],"read":[],"stuck":[],"elim":[],"back":[],"steps":[],"hard":false,"of":"1"}]}]}